WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:02.080
I was going to prepare properly

00:02.160 --> 00:02.960
But I heard

00:03.120 --> 00:04.600
Elder brother went to great lengths

00:04.760 --> 00:06.160
To welcome the general

00:06.400 --> 00:08.280
How dare I steal elder brother's spotlight?

00:08.360 --> 00:09.760
I'm afraid those who don't know

00:09.840 --> 00:11.600
Would think I'm forming factions for personal gain

00:11.680 --> 00:12.880
Prince of Jin

00:12.960 --> 00:14.360
Be cautious with words

00:16.160 --> 00:17.520
The general guards Tianhe

00:17.960 --> 00:19.920
Is a pillar of the state

00:20.000 --> 00:21.600
Rarely returns to the capital

00:21.680 --> 00:23.080
The proper courtesies

00:23.360 --> 00:24.760
Should still be observed

00:25.720 --> 00:26.640
My second brother

00:26.720 --> 00:27.960
Is habitually impulsive

00:28.040 --> 00:29.360
Please excuse him, general

00:29.440 --> 00:30.120
Your Highness

00:30.200 --> 00:31.760
You humble your subject too much

00:31.840 --> 00:32.920
The inner hall is about to begin the banquet

00:33.040 --> 00:33.880
Prince of Jin

00:33.960 --> 00:35.120
Prince of Ning

00:35.200 --> 00:36.600
Please

00:36.680 --> 00:37.880
Please

